4.90  2026-09-25

  - DD-1050: removed 'lib' from _skip_dependency_module's skip-list
    regex in StandaloneImage.pm. Unlike strict/warnings (true
    compile-time-only pragmas), lib.pm is a real, physically-requirable
    module whose import() runs real code (unshift @INC) - any 'use lib'
    reached through StandaloneRuntime.pm's require wrapper at runtime
    needs the actual lib.pm file bundled. Confirmed live via a real
    GitHub Release linux-amd64 binary (commit bf1c4ccc/v4.87) crashing
    --help and jq with "Can't locate lib.pm in @INC" in a hostile env -i
    container. Same class of defect as DD-1022 (overload).

4.89  2026-09-24

  - DD-1052: quoted every status-format[N] literal in the zsh/bash/sh
    POSIX-family shell blocks of _dd_apply_tmux_ticket_status inside
    share/private-cli/_dashboard-core. An unquoted status-format[N]
    is treated as a glob pattern by zsh, which aborts the shell hook
    with a NOMATCH error under zsh's default options - crashing the
    tmux ticket-status integration on macOS, whose default shell is
    zsh. PowerShell block left unquoted (different argument-parsing
    model, does not reproduce the bug).

